                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111W74/1</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gerard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1914-08-08">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 8, 1914</hi>.</date> [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Received August 9, 7 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>German Government will observe neutrality of Liberia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gerard</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
